# Sortify does not require environment variables to launch.
# Configure AI provider settings inside the application (Settings -> AI & Privacy).
# API keys are stored in the OS credential store (Windows Credential Manager / Keyring)
# and are never written to settings.json or committed to version control.
#
# Optional override for application data directory (settings.json, history.sqlite3, sortify.log):
# SORTIFY_DATA_DIR=
